atus":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作昭。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p003","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"start":90,"end":91,"surface":"卿","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p003:r0090","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p003","person_id":"q2u_kqh_bt5","referent_role":"addressee","quote":"融躁于名利，自恃人地，三十內望爲公輔。初爲司徒法曹，詣王僧佑，因遇沈昭略，未相識。昭略屢顧盼，謂主人曰：「是何年少？」融殊不平，謂曰：「僕出於扶桑，入于湯穀，照耀天下，誰雲不知，而卿此問？」昭略云：「不知許事，且食蛤蜊。」融曰：「物以群分，方以類聚，君長東隅，居然應嗜此族。」其高自標置如此。","note":"本句按敘述視點回指昭。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong","book_id":"b-nanshi-021","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-021-wangrong-ws1752646"},{"start":125,"end":126,"surface":"君","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p003:r0125","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p003","person_id":"q2u_kqh_bt5","referent_role":"addressee","quote":"融躁于名利，自恃人地，三十內望爲公輔。初爲司徒法曹，詣王僧佑，因遇沈昭略，未相識。昭略屢顧盼，謂主人曰：「是何年少？」融殊不平，謂曰：「僕出於扶桑，入于湯穀，照耀天下，誰雲不知，而卿此問？」昭略云：「不知許事，且食蛤蜊。」融曰：「物以群分，方以類聚，君長東隅，居然應嗜此族。」其高自標置如此。","note":"本句按敘述視點回指昭。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong","book_id":"b-nanshi-021","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-021-wangrong-ws1752646"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-shenzhao","person_id":"q2u_kqh_bt5","surfaces":["沈昭略"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-nanqishu-043-xieyue"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-043","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue","source_id":"s-nanqishu043-ws2400356","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p007","quote":"初，兄朏爲吳興，𤅢於征虜渚送別，朏指𤅢口曰：「此中唯宜飲酒。」𤅢建武之初，專以長酣爲事，與劉瑱沈昭略以觴酌交飲，各至數斗。"}],"rationale":"與𤅢劉瑱共飲的沈昭略，來源內具名交遊者；不憑姓氏接沈文季親屬，其他傳文待獨立讀。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p007","unit_id":"xieyue-complete","text":"初，兄